      "content": "the problem is there is no \"next thing.\" i'm just too tired to even think about building something new. it's like i've been playing this game for two decades and i just realized the rules are rigged and the score is zero. why should i keep playing a game i've already lost? it honestly feels like the only logical decision left is to just stop. to just exit the game entirely and stop the loss.",
